{"id":"2022-zhejiang-22","year":2022,"subject":"数学","exam_type":"普通高考","paper":"浙江卷","regions":["浙江"],"question_no":22,"question_type":"solution","stem":"设函数 $f(x)=\\frac{\\mathrm e}{2x}+\\ln x\\ (x>0)$。（1）求 $f(x)$ 的单调区间；（2）已知 $a,b\\in\\mathbb R$，曲线 $y=f(x)$ 上不同三点处的切线都经过点 $(a,b)$。证明：（i）若 $a>\\mathrm e$，则 $0<b-f(a)<\\frac12(\\frac a{\\mathrm e}-1)$；（ii）若 $0<a<\\mathrm e$ 且 $x_1<x_2<x_3$，则 $\\frac2{\\mathrm e}+\\frac{\\mathrm e-a}{6\\mathrm e^2}<\\frac1{x_1}+\\frac1{x_3}<\\frac2a-\\frac{\\mathrm e-a}{6\\mathrm e^2}$。","options":null,"answer":"（1）减区间 $(0,\\frac{\\mathrm e}{2})$，增区间 $(\\frac{\\mathrm e}{2},+\\infty)$；（2）证明略","analysis":null,"knowledge_points":["导数","函数单调性","切线"],"difficulty":"难题","source":{"repository":"deekur/gaokaomath","file":"普通高考/2022/2022浙江.pdf","sha":"754cf398b650e7148a5b5cd66118113271d8abb8"}}
